hadiths[count]{hadithnumber,text}:
"2090","Jabir bin 'Abdullah (R.A) ne farmaya:\n\nSa'd bin Ar-Rabi (R.A) ki biwi apnay do Sa'd ki betiyon ko lekar Rasoolullah (S.A.W) ke paas aayi aur boli: Aye Allah ke Rasool (S.A.W)! yeh do Sa'd bin Ar-Rabi (R.A) ki betiyan hain, jinhone aap ke saath Youm-e- Uhud mein jihad kiya aur shaheed ho gaye. Unhon ne un ki maal"
"2091","Huzail bin Shurahbil ne farmaya: \"Ek shakhs Abu Musa aur Salman bin Rabiah (raziyallahu anhuma) ke paas aaya aur un se beti ke bare mein sawal kiya...\""
"2092","Al-Harith ne riwayat ki ke Ali (radi Allahu anhu) ne farmaya: \"Tum aayat padhte ho: Wasiyaton ada karne ke baad aur qarzon ke ada karne ke baad.\""
"2093","Al-Harith ne riwayat ki ke Ali (R.A) ne farmaya: \"Rasool Allah (S.A.W) ne faisla farmaya ke ek hi maa aur baap ke aulaad (beta aur beti) meerath mein shareek hain.\""
"2094","Jabir bin Abdullah (R.A) ne farmaya: \"Rasool Allah (S.A.W) mere paas aaye jab main bimar tha Banu Salamah mein. Maine kaha: 'Aey Allah ke Nabi (S.A.W)! Mere maal ko mere aulad mein kaise taqseem karoon?' Lekin unhon ne mujh se koi jawab nahi diya.\""
"2095","Ahmad ibn Mani' ne riwayat ki, Yazid ibn Harun ne riwayat ki, Abu Ghassan se, Muhammad ibn Mutarrif ne riwayat ki, Hassan ibn Atiyyah ne riwayat ki, Abu Umamah (raziyallahu anhu) ne riwayat ki, Nabi Kareem (sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya:\n\n\"Hayā (sharm-o-hayā) aur 'iyy (kam baat karna) īmān ke do shaakh hain, jabke badhā'at (badtameezi) aur bayān (ziyaadat se baat karna) nifāq ke do shaakh hain.\"\n\nAbu 'Isa (Tirmizi) ne farmaya: \"Yeh hasan gharīb hadith hai; hum ise sirf Abu Ghassan Muhammad ibn Mutarrif ki riwayat se jaante hain.\" Unhone yeh bhi wazahat ki: \"'Iyy matlab kam baat karna hai, badhā'at matlab zubaan ki badtameezi hai, aur bayān matlab ziyaadat se baat karna hai — jaise woh khaṭīb jo khutbe dete hain, apni baat ko phailaate hain aur usmein fasāhat dikhāte hain, logon ki us tarah ta'areef karte hain jo Allah ko pasand nahi aati.\""
"2096","Ibn 'Abbas (R.A) ne riwayat ki ke Rasoolullah (S.A.W) ne farmaya: \"Warasat ke hisson ko un logon do jinke haqdar hain. Jo baqi bache...\""
"2097","Imran bin Husain (R.A) ne riwayat ki: \"Ek shakhs Nabi Kareem (S.A.W) ke paas aaya aur bola: 'Mera beta mar gaya...'\""
"2098","Qabisah bin Dhuw'aib ne farmaya: \"Ek daadi - yaani maa ki maa...\""
"2099","Qabisah bin Dhuw'aib (رضي الله عنه) ne farmaya:\n\n\"Aik daadi (naani) Hazrat Abu Bakr Siddiq (رضي الله الله عنه) ke paas apni meeras (warasat) ke baare mein poochne aayi. Unhon ne us se farmaya:\""
"2100","# Hadith ka Tarjuma (Scholarly Roman Urdu)\n\n**Yahya ibn Aktham aur al-Jarud ibn Mu'adh ne humein riwayat ki, donon ne farmaya:** al-Fadl ibn Musa ne humein riwayat ki; **al-Husayn ibn Waqid ne humein riwayat ki,** Awf ibn Dahlam ki rivayat se, Nafi' ki rivayat se, **Ibn 'Umar** رضي الله عنهما ki rivayat se, unhone farmaya:\n\n**Rasoolullah** ﷺ **mimbir par chadhe aur buland awaz mein pukara, farmaaye:**\n\n*\"Aey un logon ki jama'at jinhon ne apni zubaanon se Islam liya hai lekin iman abhi tak unke dilon mein nahi pahuncha: Musalmanon ko nuqsan na pahunchana, un par ilzaam na lagana, aur un ki khamiyyaan talash na karna. Kyunki jo shakhs apne Musalman bhai ki khamiyyaan talash karega, Allah Ta'ala uski bhi khamiyyaan talash karega; aur jis shakhs ki khamiyyaan Allah talash karega, ushe zahir kar dega, goya woh apne ghar ke andar se andar ho.\"*\n\n**Ibn 'Uram** رضي الله عنهما ne farmaya: \"Ek din unhone Baytullah (ya'ni Ka'bah) ki taraf dekha aur farmaaye: *'Tum kitne bade ho, aur tumhara hurmat kitni badi hai! Lekin momin Allah ke nazdeik tumse bhi zyada hurmat wala hai.'*\"\n\n**Abu 'Isa** (al-Tirmidhī) ne farmaya: \"Yeh ek *hasan gharīb* hadith hai. Hum ise sirf al-Husayn ibn Waqid ki rivayat se jaante hain. Isḥāq ibn Ibrāhīm al-Samarqandī ne bhi al-Husayn ibn Waqid se isi jaisi kuch riwayat ki hai, aur isi jaisi riwayat Abū Barzah al-Aslamī رضي الله"
"2101","Abu Umamah bin Sahl bin Hunaif (Razi Allah unho ne) ne farmaya:\n\n\"Umar bin Al-Khattab (Razi Allah unho ne) ne mujhe Abu Ubaidah (Razi Allah unho ke paas) ek khat ke saath bheja jismein yeh tha ke Rasool Allah (Sallallahu Alaihi Wasallam) ne farmaya: 'Jis ke koi wali na ho, uski zimmedari Allah aur uske Rasool (Sallallahu Alaihi Wasallam) ke zimme hai. Aur jis ke koi waris na ho, uski miras uske mamoon (maternal uncle) ko milegi.'\""
"2102","Ali ibn Hujr ne hamaare saamne rivaayat ki: Isma'il ibn 'Ayyash ne hamaare saamne rivaayat ki, 'Umarah ibn Ghaziyyah se, Abu al-Zubayr se, Jabir se, aur Nabiyy (sallallahu 'alayhi wa sallam) se rivaayat hai, jinhon ne farmaya: \"Jise koi tohfa diya gaya aur uske paas saamarthya ho, to usse uska badla de. Agar uske paas saamarthya na ho, to us ki ta'areef kare. Kyunki jis ne ta'areef ki, us ne shukr ada kiya, aur jis ne ne'mat chhupaayi, us ne na-shukri ki. Aur jise kuch na diya gaya aur us ne apne aap ko us se sajaaya, to woh us shakhs ke barabar hai jis ne jhoote libaas pehne hain.\" Abu 'Isa ne kaha: Yeh ek hasan gharib hadith hai. Is mauzoo' par Asma' bint Abi Bakr aur 'Aishah (radiyallahu 'anhuma) se bhi rivaayaten hain. Unke iraade, \"Jis ne chhupaayi, us ne na-shukri ki,\" ka matlab yeh hai ki us ne ne'mat se inkaar kiya."
"2103","# Scholarly Roman Urdu Translation\n\n**al-Husayn ibn al-Hasan al-Marwazi ne Makkah mein hum se riwayat ki, aur Ibrahim ibn Sa'id al-Jawhari ne hum se riwayat ki, unhone kaha: al-Ahwas ibn Jawwab ne Su'ayr ibn al-Khims se riwayat ki, Su'ayr ne Sulayman al-Taymi se riwayat ki, Sulayman ne Abu 'Uthman al-Nahdi se riwayat ki, aur Abu 'Uthman ne Usamah ibn Zayd (radhi Allahu 'anhu) se riwayat ki, unhone kaha: Rasool Allah (sallallahu alayhi wa sallam) ne farmaya: \"Jis shakhs ne kisi par ehsaan kiya aur us ehsaan karne wale ne usse kaha 'Jazak Allahu khairan' (Allah tumhe behtar se behtar badlein ata farmaye), to usne saree tareeq se tareef ki.\"**\n\n**Abu 'Isa ne kaha: Ye ek hasan jayyid gharib hadith hai. Hum Usamah ibn Zayd ki hadith mein iske siwa is silsile se ise nahi jaante. Ye Abu Hurayrah (radhi Allahu 'anhu) se bhi Nabi (sallallahu alayhi wa sallam) ki taraf mansoob hai, isi tarah ke alfaaz mein. Main ne Muhammad (ya'ni al-Bukhari) se iske baare mein poocha, magar woh ise nahi jaante the.**\n\n---\n\n**'Abd al-Rahim ibn Hazim al-Balkhi ne mujh se riwayat ki, unhone kaha: Main ne al-Maki ibn Ibrahim se suna, woh kehte the: Hum Ibn Jurayj al-Maki ke saath the ke ek bhikhaari aaya aur usne un se madad maangi. Ibn Jurayj ne apne khazanchi se kaha, \"Use ek dinaar de do.\" Khazanchi ne kaha, \"Mere paas sirf ek dinaar hai; agar main de doonga to main aur meri family bhookhe reh jayenge.\" Ibn Jurayj ghusse hue aur bole, \"Use de do.\" Al-Maki ne kaha: Hum Ibn Jurayj ke saath hi the ke ek aadmi ek khat aur ek thaili lekar aaya. Uski taraf uske bhai ne bheja tha, aur khat mein likha tha: \"Main ne tumhe pachaas dinaar bheje hain.\" Ibn Jurayj ne thaili khol kar ginne laga, aur wahan ikyaavvan (51) dinaar the. Phir unhone apne khazanchi se kaha: \"Tumne ek dinaar diya, aur Allah ne tumhe wapas kar diya aur pachaas aur zyada kar diye.\"**\n\n---\n\n*Wa Allahu A'lam*"
"2104","Rasoolullah Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam ney farmaya : ''apney ladkey ko adab sikhaana eik saa sadqa deney sey behtar hai.'' Imam Tirmizi kehtey hain : 1- ye hadees gharib hai. 2- Raavi Naasah ki kunniyat Abul Alaa hai, aur ye koofa key rehney waley hain, muhaddeseen key nazdik qawi nahin hain, ye hadees sirf isi sanad sey maroof hai. 3- Naasah eik doosrey Shaikh bhi hain jo Basra key rehney waley hain, Ammar bin Abu Ammar waghera sey hadees riwayat kartey hain, aur ye un sey ziyada qawi hain."
"2105","Rasoolullah Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam ney farmaya : ''Hasan adab sey behtar kisi baap ney apney betey ko tohfa nahin diya.'' Imam Tirmizi kehtey hain : 1- ye hadees gharib hai, hum isey sirf Aamir bin Abu-Aamir Khazzaaz ki riwayat sey jantey hain, aur Aamir Saleh bin Rustam Khazzaaz key betey hain. 2- Raavi Ayub bin Musa sey murad Ayub bin Musa bin Amr bin Saeed bin Aas hain. 3- ye hadees merey nazdik mursal hai."
"2106","Rasoolullah Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam hadiya qubul kartey they aur uska badla detey they. Imam Tirmizi kehtey hain : 1- ye hadees is sanad sey Hasan gharib sahih hai. 2- hum isey sirf Esa bin Yunus ki riwayat sey jantey hain, jisey wo Hisham sey riwayat kartey hain. 3- is bab mein Abu-Huraira, Anas, ibne-Umar aur Jabir (Raziallauh anhum) sey bhi hadeesen aai hain."
"2107","Rasoolullah Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam ney farmaya : ''jo logon ka shukariya ada na karey wo Allah ka shukar ada nahin kerega.''  Imam Tirmizi kehtey hain : ye hadees Hasan sahih hai."
"2108","Rasoolullah Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam ney farmaya : ''jisney logon ka shukariya ada na kiya usney Allah ka shukar ada nahin kiya.'' Imam Tirmizi kehtey hain : 1- ye hadees Hasan sahih hai. 2- is bab mein abu-Huraira, Ash-as bin Qais aur Noman bin Bashir (Raziallauh anhum) sey bhi hadeesen aai hain."
"2109","Rasoolullah Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam ney farmaya : ''apney bhai key samney tumhara muskarana tumharey liye sadqa hai, tumhara bhalai ka hukm dena aur burai sey rokna sadqa hai, bhatak janey wali jagah mein kisi aadmi ko tumhara raasta dikhaana tumharey liye sadqa hai, na-bina aur kam dekhney waley aadmi ko raasta dikhaana tumharey liye sadqa hai, patthar , kaanta aur haddi ko raastey sey hataanaa tumharey liye sadqa hai, apney dol sey apney bhai key dol main tumhara pani dalna tumharey liye sadqa hai.'' Imam Tirmizi kehtey hain : 1- ye hadees Hasan gharib hai. 2- is bab mein ibne-Masood , Jabir , Huzefa , Aaisha aur Abu-Hurera (Raziallauh anhum) sey ahadees aai hain."
"2110","mainey Rasoolullah Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam ko farmatey huye suna : '' jis shakhs ney doodh ka Atiya diya padhi. , ya chaandi qarz di, ya kisi ko raasta bataya , usey ghulam azad karney key barabar sawab milega.'' Imam Tirmizi kehtey hain : 1- ye hadees Abu-Is'haq ki riwayat sey jisey wo Talha bin Musrif sey riwayat kartey hain Hasan sahih gharib hai, hum isey sirf isi sanad sey jantey hain. 2- Mansoor bin Moa'tamir aur Shoba ney bhi is hadees ki riwayat Talha bin Musrif sey ki hai. 3- is bab mein Noman bin Bashir Raziallahu anhuma sey bhi hadees aai hai. 4- (من منح منيحة ورق) ka matlab hai bator qarz dena (هدى"
"2111","Nabi Akram Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam ney farmaya : '' eik aadmi raastey par chal raha tha ke usey eik kaantay daar dali mili , usney isey raastey sey hata diya, Allah Taala ney uskey is kaam sey khush ho kar us ko badla diya yani uski maghfirat farma di.'' Imam Tirmizi kehtey hain : 1- ye hadees Hasan sahih hai. 2- is bab mein abu-Barza , ibne-Abbas aur Abu-Zar (Raziallauh anhum) sey bhi ahadees aai hain."
"2112","Nabi Akram Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam ney farmaya : '' jab koi aadmi tum sey koi baat bayan karey phir ( usey raz mein rakhney key liye ( daain baain mud kar dekhey to wo baat tumharey paas amanat hai''. Imam Tirmizi kehtey hain : 1- ye hadees Hasan hai. 2- hum isey sirf ibne-Abi Zi-ib ki riwayat sey jantey hain."
"2113","mainey arz kiya : Allah key Rasool ! merey ghar mein sirf Zuber ki kamai hai, kya main is mein sey sadqa aur khairat karun? aap ney farmaya : ''haan, sadqa karo aur gireh mat lagaao warna tumharey ooper gireh laga di jaeygi.''  (لا توكي فيوكى عليك) ka matlab ye hai ke shumar kar key sadqa na karo warna Allah Taala bhi shumar kerega aur barkat khatam kar dega. Imam Tirmizi kehtey hain : 1- ye hadees Hasan sahih hai. 2- baaz raawiyon ney is hadees ko :(عن ابن أبي مليكة an عباد بن عبد الله بن الزبير an أسماء بنت أبي بكر رضي الله عنهما) ki sanad sey riwayat ki hai padhi. , kaee logon ney is hadees ki riwayat Ayub sey ki hai aur is mein Ibaad bin Ubedullah bin Zuber ka zikr nahin kiya. 2- is bab mein Aaisha aur Abu-Hurera Raziallahu anhuma sey bhi ahadees aai hain."
"2114","Nabi Akram Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam ney farmaya : ''sakhi aadmi Allah sey qarib hai, jannat sey qarib hai, logon sey qarib hai aur jahannam sey door hai, bakheel aadmi Allah sey door hai, jannat sey door hai, logon sey door hai, aur jahannam sey qarib hai, jahil sakhi Allah key nazdik bakheel abid sey kahin ziyada mehbub hai.'' Imam Tirmizi kehtey hain : 1- ye hadees gharib hai. 2- hum isey (Yahya bin Saeed an Al Aaraj an abi Huraia) ki sanad sey sirf Saad bin Muhammad ki riwayat sey jantey hain, aur Yahya bin Saeed sey is hadees ki riwayat karney mein Saeed bin Muhammad ki mukhalifat ki gaee hai, ( Saeed bin Muhammad ney to is sanad sey riwayat ki hai jo ooper mazkur (zikr hui) hai) jabke ye (an Yahya bin Saeed an Aaysha) ki sanad sey bhi mursalan marvi (riwayat hui) hai."
"2115","Rasoolullah Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam ney farmaya : ''momin key andar do khaslatein bukhl (kanjusi) aur badakhlaaqi jama nahin ho saktin.'' Imam Tirmizi kehtey hain : 1- ye hadees gharib hai, hum isey sirf Sadqa bin Musa ki riwayat sey hi jantey hain. padhi. 2- is bab mein Abu-Hurera (Raziallahu anhu) sey bhi riwayat hai,"
